  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Pub/Sub Integration with the Amazon SNS Connector",
    "splashDescription": "The Amazon SNS Connector is essential for organizations that need seamless integration between business processes and Amazon's managed pub/sub service, Simple Notification Service (SNS). Specializing in both sending and receiving messages, this Connector ensures that your processes are always synced with Amazon SNS in real time.",
